IP: [<ffffffff8110f3a7>] __mark_inode_dirty+0xca/0x1ac
PGD 9fe96067 PUD 30e34067 PMD 0
Oops: 0000 [#1] SMP
...
Call Trace:
 ? touch_atime+0x111/0x13a
 ? filldir+0x0/0xc3
 ? vfs_readdir+0x84/0xaa
 ? sys_getdents+0x7d/0xcd
